# Wardogs and other Epic Online Services / Pragma titles — the login and matchmaking backends.
# These are the endpoints the client stalls on: the TLS ClientHello leaves and nothing comes back.
# The strategy carries a dedicated profile for them (multisplit pos=1,midsld) — the general TLS
# profiles do not open them. Gameplay itself is UDP to bare IPs and needs no hostlist.
pragmaengine.com
firstlook.gg
epicgames.dev
